b0F since 1899.","t_mon":"Lows rose in 8 of 12 months. Highs rose in 10 of 12 months.","t_rain":"Rain and snow: no clear long-term change","p_rain":"Flagstaff's yearly precipitation shows no clear long-term change (+0.03 inches per decade, a range that includes zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 20.4 inches a year. The wettest year was 1965 (36.59 in); the driest, 2020 (9.59 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":true,"hi":true},"t_year":"2026 so far: 16 daily record highs, no daily record lows"}}